# the built binary
/tracker

# local env overrides — these hold the database password
.env
*.env
!.env.example

# what the UI grading routes last ran (cmd/uiverify). This is EVIDENCE, not a record: the
# committed record is FRONTEND-CONVENTIONS-RECORD.md, and `make verify-ui-record` checks that
# record against these run artefacts. Committing them would let the check pass on a run nobody
# had made.
/build/
